Features of RTGS:
This electronic system is controlled by RBI. There is no physical exchange of
money. Th RBI makes adjustment in the electronic accounts of both the banks.
The RTGS system is suited for high value transactions (minimum value of
transaction should be ₹2,00,000).
The payment is taken as final and irrevocable.
Fees of RTGS vary from bank to bank.
