Insurance is a contract between the insurer and insured in which
insurer agrees to make good the loss of insured on happening of an
event in consideration of a regular payment called premium. This
agreement or contract is in writing and is known as insurance policy.
The important terms used in insurance contract are
• Insurer: Is the individual or firm known as Insurance company
which agrees to compensate the loss of insured.
Insured: Is the individual or firm who gets compensation of loss.
Insured pays regular amount of premium.
Happening of the event: It refers to the subject matter of policy or
the kinds of losses covered under the policy/
Premium: It refers to an amount paid quarterly, half-yearly or
time of loss.
